  "nodes": {
    "start": {
      "text": "New room, empty floor? I know that look. Steel cot with mattress, four thousand five hundred. Induction stove, two thousand two hundred — gas cylinder takes a month and a bribe. Delivery up the steps is free; my knees are not.",
