        {
          "text": "The cot, with mattress. (₹4,500)",
          "next": "cot",
          "effect": {
            "wallet": -4500,
            "flags": {
              "bed_bought": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "A second-hand cot? Anything cheaper?",
          "next": "secondhand"
        },
        {
          "text": "Induction stove. (₹2,200)",
          "next": "stove",
          "effect": {
            "wallet": -2200,
            "flags": {
              "stove_bought": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Not today.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ]
    },
    "secondhand": {
      "text": "One. The maroon-door boy's. Two thousand, mattress smells of his cousin. Take it?",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Take it. (₹2,000)",
          "next": "cot",
          "effect": {
            "wallet": -2000,
            "flags": {
              "bed_bought": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "No. The new one. (₹4,500)",
          "next": "cot",
          "effect": {
            "wallet": -4500,
            "flags": {
              "bed_bought": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Let me think.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ]
    },
    "cot": {
      "text": "Boy will carry it up. Sleep well tonight — first night in your own room, nobody sleeps well. Tomorrow you will."
    },
    "stove": {
      "text": "Two plates, one works properly. Don't put a steel glass on it, it screams."
    },
    "bed_done": {
      "text": "Cot reached? Good. Stove, two thousand two hundred, when you're tired of Mani's chai for dinner.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Induction stove. (₹2,200)",
          "next": "stove",
          "effect": {
            "wallet": -2200,
            "flags": {
              "stove_bought": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Later.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ]
    },
    "stocked": {
      "text": "Cot, stove — next is a fridge. Salary day, come. I'll keep the small white one."
    },
    "bye": {
      "text": "Shop is open till the light goes. Literally — power cut at eight, usually."
    }
